    "stac_version": "1.1.0",
    "description": "The MYDFNSS data set consists of MODIS Atmosphere and Ancillary Product subsets that are generated over a number of FluxNet sites. FLUXNET consists of a network of regional networks of micrometeorological tower sites located around the globe. The products are distributed through subscriptions to various end users but are also archived in LAADS and are available to the general user community.\n\nThe process of generating subset cutouts involves locating and identifying a FluxNet sites from a 5 minute Level-2 MODIS granule and extracting 0.5 x 0.5 degree cutouts. The MODARNSS data set consists of subsets for around 180 AERONET sites around the globe. There is one file per site with 55 Science Data Sets (SDS) contained within each HDF product file.\n\nVisit the [FluxNet web site](http://fluxnet.ornl.gov/) for more informaiton about FluxNet sites.",
